{"id":"en_thirsty-for-the-wet-nurse","title":"Thirsty for the Wet Nurse","titleEn":"Thirsty for the Wet Nurse","description":"Ella has no mate, no wolf, and is bringing up a pup by herself. A single kind gesture, however, unexpectedly binds her future to Alpha Torin, a man under a curse that forbids him from touching any woman. She takes on the role of wet nurse for his newborn heir, and in doing so enters the Alpha's keep, where she finds herself caught in a lethal web of envy and treachery. Those who want to follow this series can do so on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/thirsty-for-the-wet-nurse/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/thirsty-for-the-wet-nurse/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Forbidden Love","Royalty","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dscnw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_thirsty-for-the-wet-nurse_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dscnw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_thirsty-for-the-wet-nurse_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dscnw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_thirsty-for-the-wet-nurse_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dscnw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_thirsty-for-the-wet-nurse_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dscnw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_thirsty-for-the-wet-nurse_5","title":"Episode 5"